      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you are feeling like your life is too much of a burden, it means you are in immense pain, and that pain is driving these thoughts. Please know that the relief you imagine coming from ending things is a temporary illusion that the pain itself is trying to convince you of. There are ways to make the weight stop without ending your life; reaching out to a crisis line can connect you with immediate, non-judgmental support. Please call or text 988 right now.",
